            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[The menu bar now shows an amber needs-input count beside the owl. The badge disappears at zero, remains visible while locating a terminal, and displays 99+ for larger counts. The exact count remains available to accessibility and in the dropdown, alongside active session totals.

Codex sessions waiting for input now match terminal titles with the “Action Required” prefix. A unique title/project match opens directly; duplicate or uncertain matches still use the chooser.
]]></description>
